{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119887","id":3772564103,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7g3MKH","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119887","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119887.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119887.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119887","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119887/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119887/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119887/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a3b842f86792dcec5afd8aac3f4a2e85a73b8525","number":119887,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Change default physics bias to 0.2 (from 0.8)","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- A Baumgarte bias setting of 0.8 is higher than recommended in literature. (0.2 - 0.3 recommended)\r\n- Fixes excess bounciness and instability. \r\n- Makes Godot Physics acceptable in my game (it was volatile with a large body count)\r\n- Collision bias and constraint bias defaults were vastly different, making it hard to create a stable fix for joints.\r\n- This default setting is a roadblock to demonstrating further physics solver and stability fixes and improvements.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- Most modern external engines don't use Baumgarte bias but calculate it from softness settings, so they likely ignore this change anyway. Rapier add on remains unchanged, but I haven't tested any other add ons.\r\n- I have tested with the Godot-demo-projects box stacking and pyramid tests (which are unchanged) and my own game and tests (which sees a big behaviour improvement).\r\n- This change could be registered by users who rely on contact impulse reporting and are used to more erratic impulses.\r\n\r\nI think the problem might have slipped in by accident, and if so, it seems like a no brainer to fix. If it causes some other problem, then I imagine there is some other issue to be looked at.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labe